      "mergedPostDetails": "So, I've been working on some new avis quite recently and I discovered that on quest, VRC constraints are completely broken to the point where they're unable to work at all on their end. I first noticed this with this y-bot Avi I made where you could change the FPS. However, after one of the updates it, as well as other avatars using the new constraints broke on the quest side. If you'd like to see one of the avis I'm refering to, here's the link, https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_39d55231-962f-4811-ba30-1d2a1ba633b3",
